      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense, i have been a bit stressed lately so i probably am grinding my teeth. i felt a little bit of pressure in my shoulder too but it went away pretty fast. do you think i should take anything for the tension? maybe some ibuprofen or something? i dont want to make a big deal out of it if it's just stress.",
